        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9027P, Bar Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOmnia's Ultima II Bar Door Handle is a simple yet modern door pull that is a quick and easy way to add contemporary style to almost any front door. The Bar Door Pull is available in 12 inch and 18 inch center to center lengths. It comes packaged with thru-bolt mounts for a secure installation. The Omnia Ultima II 9027P Door Pull is available in a collection of rich, modern finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia Ultima II 9027P Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: for doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Includes installation hardware required for fiberglass, wood, and metal doors.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>9027P/305:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>9027P/457:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Face Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Omnia 9027P Pull is also available as a <a href=\"/products/bar-back-to-back-pulls-pair-omnia-btb-9027p\"><b>Back to Back Mounted Pair</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-C08PC3_size.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Omnia Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>",
